#, no-wrap
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "事前準備"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/data-mobilization/modules/ROOT/pages/description.adoc:41
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/description.adoc:32
msgid "Basic skills in computer and internet use, and, in particular, in the use of spreadsheets."
msgstr "具備電腦及網路使用的基本技能，特別是試算表的使用。"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/description.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Topics"
msgstr "主題"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/description.adoc:8
msgid "Using GBIF-mediated data for biodiversity research"
msgstr "運用 GBIF 提供的資料進行生物多樣性研究"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/description.adoc:9
msgid "Searching GBIF.org"
msgstr "搜尋 GBIF.org"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/description.adoc:10
msgid "Examining the data quality of a dataset"
msgstr "檢視資料集的資料品質"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/description.adoc:11
msgid "Using the GBIF API"
msgstr "使用 GBIF API"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/description.adoc:12
msgid "Using rGBIF"
msgstr "使用 rGBIF"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/description.adoc:14
msgid "This course is comprised of videos and documentation paired with quizzes and practical exercises."
msgstr "本課程包含影片與文字教學，並搭配測驗與實作練習。"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/description.adoc:21
msgid "This course is designed for individuals who work as researchers or technicians in biodiversity research or policy institutions. The instruction provided is particularly useful for those who have a need or desire to use GBIF-mediated data in their own research or analyses."
msgstr "這門課程是為生物多樣性領域相關的研究者、技術員或政策單位所設計，若您需要、想要將GBIF提供之資料運用於自身研究及分析之中，此課程說明將對您特別有用。"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/description.adoc:28
#: en/epn/modules/ROOT/pages/description.adoc:28
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/description.adoc:32
msgid "https://docs.gbif.org/course-introduction-to-gbif[Introduction to GBIF course^]"
msgstr "https://docs.gbif.org/course-introduction-to-gbif[GBIF 課程簡介^]"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/description.adoc:30
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/description.adoc:34
msgid "Additionally, individuals completing this course should possess the following skills and knowledge:"
msgstr "此外，完成本課程的學員應具備以下技能與知識："

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/description.adoc:33
msgid "Basic understanding of computer-based geographical and statistical analysis tools, e.g. GIS and R, and may have already run analyses using these tools."
msgstr "對電腦地理和統計分析工具，例如 GIS 和 R 有基本的了解，並且可能已經會使用這些工具進行分析。"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/description.adoc:34
msgid "Basic knowledge about geography and biodiversity informatics: geography and mapping concepts, basic taxonomy and nomenclature rules."
msgstr "對於地理與生物多樣性資訊有基礎的認識，如：了解地理和地圖之概念、知道基礎的分類學與命名規則。"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/description.adoc:35
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/description.adoc:36
msgid "A good command of English. While efforts are made to provide materials in other languages, instruction/videos will be in English."
msgstr "雖然我們會盡力提供其他語言的教材，但教學內容及影片將以英語進行。"

